# Ship to main

When a user-requested change is done, commit only the files for that change and `git push origin HEAD` to `main`. Do not ask “want it on main?”

- Bump `index.html` `V` and `sw.js` `CACHE` together when the live PWA changes
- Leave unrelated dirty files (scout, funnel, `marketing/`) unstaged
- Do not force-push; do not skip hooks
- If they say not to ship a specific change, skip the push for that one
